msgstr "Reviewer Report Comparison"

msgid "plugins.generic.reviewCompare.description"
msgstr "The reports of one round side by side: each reviewer's recommendation, review-form answers question by question, comments to the author and editor, and time taken; with a reviewer-agreement indicator (consensus/close/divergent), a provisional decision suggestion and a printable decision brief for the board. Developed by Moustafa Mahmoud — Khibrat Taibah."

